        "quiz_id": 9930,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The table below shows daily oil production in 4 countries from 2000 to 2004. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IL99d1cAmoLfKUx8CPllvQ9WgDb\"><em><strong>The table below shows daily oil production in 4 countries from 2000 to 2004. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Daily oil production in 4 countries: 2000 - 2004</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MD73dfWrco9O9mx8qColoHIxgUh\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>Idea cho overview:&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L1PCdHLZuo4EHHxg2w6l7p8ogHG\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Team Academic IELTS 1984</strong></span> x&aacute;c định được 3 đặc điểm nổi bật sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjG5dosqzobK2YxITI3lisRagyh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ngoại trừ Congo th&igrave; sản lượng dầu ở tất cả c&aacute;c nước đều tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C21GdjNM9of5Sjx9Q0alfIWegYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Congo v&agrave; Nigeria sản xuất nhiều dầu hơn xa so với 2 nước c&ograve;n lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWOUdCxGto6MLXx5TvXlHnkugee\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Chad sản xuất dầu &iacute;t nhất, nhưng c&oacute; tăng trưởng mạnh nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjyAdjBdlobSIYxlDCGloC7lgte\">&nbsp;</div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9BpduJ1OoAHIbxLK7pluIItgJd\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>C&aacute;ch ph&acirc;n body: </strong></h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AlHcd1wStoXys0xDcQNlkLtfgOd\">Với b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, <span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>team Academic IELTS 1984</strong></span> sẽ chia body theo nước:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UD8qdMqMmoIrx4xlY0ul7bCNg6b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Body 1:</span></strong> 2 nước c&oacute; sản lượng cao nhất: <strong>Congo</strong> v&agrave; <strong>Nigeria</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ox48d2Fruo76jBxmpG9lHnCYgcd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\">Body 2:</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"> </span>2 nước c&oacute; sản lượng thấp hơn: <strong>Chad</strong> v&agrave; <strong>Somalia</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TyzjdGzAzoltrqxmdUXl0XJ4gob\">&nbsp;</div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RcXtdCbCLowgyfxChzll7dTRg2g\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>C&aacute;ch viết từng c&acirc;u: </strong></h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MaeSddrtzo0EtwxrBN8lKZT7gWb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Body 1: Số liệu Congo v&agrave; Nigeria</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LKa5dr2uOoplONxK95TljsKLg1e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">C&acirc;u 1</span>:</strong> V&agrave;o năm 2000, <strong>Nigeria</strong> sản xuất 205,000 th&ugrave;ng dầu, <strong>Congo</strong> l&agrave; 275,000 th&ugrave;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TAWpd9kGVoyiSzxtvYrlg5IggJh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">C&acirc;u 2</span>:</strong> Sau đ&oacute;, số liệu của <strong>Congo</strong> giảm li&ecirc;n tục đến 203,000 th&ugrave;ng v&agrave;o năm cuối.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UFUPdoot1o1FxYx9Z4tlcenFgTe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">C&acirc;u 3</span>:</strong> Sản lượng dầu của <strong>Nigeria</strong> giảm xuống 190,000 th&ugrave;ng v&agrave;o 2002, sau đ&oacute; tăng đến 213,000 v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XjwCdk5QIoj4xixPZuAlFYb9gVf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>Body 2: Số liệu Somalia v&agrave; Chad</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X0bbdvbLYokdTlxClnNlGpxEgVf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">C&acirc;u 1</span>:</strong> <strong>Somalia</strong> sản xuất 5000 th&ugrave;ng dầu ở năm đầu, <strong>Chad</strong> th&igrave; kh&ocirc;ng sản xuất trong cả 3 năm đầu.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ew68dq3pNoa2WaxmTRrlgJYEgFh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">C&acirc;u 2</span>:</strong> Sau đ&oacute;, <strong>Chad</strong> bắt đầu sản xuất v&agrave;o 2003 (8000 th&ugrave;ng) rồi tăng l&ecirc;n mức 50,000 v&agrave;o 2004.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VySNdb1O8oF8xHx0GErlBjcigfg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">C&acirc;u 3</span>:</strong> <strong>Somalia</strong> cũng tăng, sản lượng bằng v&agrave;o với <strong>Chad </strong>v&agrave;o năm cuối.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WEZpd4L4po4AXrxxwzrlQROhgAh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QjcMdmEUyoyn99xhOfHlgGxCgub\" start=\"4\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h4 class=\"heading-4\"><strong>Paraphrasing &amp; Vocabulary: </strong></h4>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RNRrdfUHgopz2BxcmbDlRDZWgth\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>Paraphrasing:</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y2Nwdx5Z1oCM2OxHtpslNC3fgBe\">B&agrave;i n&agrave;y m&igrave;nh cần đa dạng c&aacute;ch viết \"sản xuất nhiều/ &iacute;t hơn\" để mi&ecirc;u tả sự thay đổi của số liệu.</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OSrhdEWdgod9GnxwKycl0EcygSf\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-list=\"bullet\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>X expanded/ increased its production&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OSrhdEWdgod9GnxwKycl0EcygSf\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>X experienced increases in its production</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GoPidUAijopMXxxUDISloM2tgze\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>X's production increased to [số liệu]</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DYULdx2KjoEVoSx9pXUloGlMg9c\" style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>X's production showed increases</strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AEf9dgjFAorTaLxJsS9lHyJcgUg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LcFwd9d2coEOQaxTXpQlEwRSg6G\"><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>Vocabulary:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SijSdQNudo5NptxyNTMlA0YagHd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>leading oil producer: </strong>nước sản xuất dầu dẫn đầu</span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkoLdfagPo4RFOxDmymlAyWjgjc\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>continuous declines:</strong> sự giảm li&ecirc;n tục</span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PagOdzu5YouwxoxvAPil6c4YgHd\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>rebound (v):</strong> tăng (sau khi giảm) || d&ugrave;ng khi mi&ecirc;u tả một số liệu giảm rồi lại tăng</span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PJamd2r4Mo9I5lxae0GlwndQgbd\" style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>annual growth</strong>: sự tăng trưởng trong một năm</span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DHpddiZUfo5S41xJvvjlpxhig5l\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WSXQdKa39o1EX4xPEanlC7jRgOg\"><u><strong>Note:</strong></u></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SVaydsoCVoX8h7xj7R5lMjPTgWb\">B&agrave;i viết gốc c&oacute; m&ocirc; tả như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G0bBdwzSxolpEfxgIzzlYrpRgjh\">\"Somalia produced only <strong>5,000 barrels every day</strong> in the first year.\"</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3lodtUV5oSyC2xpAwalIA8Fgih\">Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đ&atilde; nhận được feedback từ cựu gi&aacute;m khảo l&agrave; n&ecirc;n sửa th&agrave;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OPUedLXEQo5JItxqeHHlNPOsgTd\">\"Somalia produced only <strong>an average of 5,000 barrels a day</strong> in the first year.\"</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbIKdqgIYoc5mkxTUy3l7iBYg9g\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I24WdIQiYoLoEAxAiDLlrtPUg7d\">Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chi tiết nhỏ nhưng thể hiện t&iacute;nh ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c cao khi mi&ecirc;u tả số liệu v&igrave;</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Czjsdp3cwo5HnxxnajwllqcBgyr\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>\"<strong>5,000 barrels every day</strong>\" nghĩa l&agrave; mỗi ng&agrave;y đều sản xuất đ&uacute;ng 5,000 th&ugrave;ng dầu</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VwkUd7xoaoxXNwxHRUollp0BgUg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\"an average of 5,000 barrels a day\"</strong> nghĩa l&agrave; trung b&igrave;nh 5,000 th&ugrave;ng mỗi ng&agrave;y (c&oacute; ng&agrave;y c&oacute; thể thấp hơn, c&oacute; ng&agrave;y cao hơn, nhưng trung b&igrave;nh l&agrave; bao nhi&ecirc;u đ&oacute;)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NUd2dzfyuoDQFJxzs3ylfwFqgrh\">=&gt; C&aacute;ch diễn đạt thứ hai đ&uacute;ng với thực tế hơn, do đ&oacute; ch&iacute;nh x&aacute;c hơn để mi&ecirc;u tả số liệu n&agrave;y.</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3113,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AXOhdBnRtooyPcxgVYwlY4ekg2f\">The table gives information about the amount of oil produced by four countries, namely Nigeria, Chad, Congo and Somalia, between 2000 and 2004.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41511,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3114,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9aDdvXyoo677MxbJDOlcmGbgad\">Overall, with the exception of Congo, all the remaining countries <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>expanded their production</strong></span> towards the end of the period. Nigeria and Congo were by far the largest producers, whereas Chad, despite<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>showing the most substantial increases</strong></span>, produced the<strong> </strong>smallest amount of oil.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41511,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3115,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9aDdvXyoo677MxbJDOlcmGbgad\">\n<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S18FdcUFcoqJZKxtYdwlfyjXgVg\">Looking first at the <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>leading oil producers</strong></span>, in 2000, 205,000 barrels of oil were produced by Nigeria daily, which was significantly lower than Congo's production, at 275,000 barrels. Thereafter, <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>continuous declines</strong></span> were recorded in the latter country, and in 2004, its figure was 203,000 barrels per day. In contrast, <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>Nigeria's production decreased to</strong></span> 190,000 barrels in 2002, but then <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>rebounded</strong> </span>to 213,000 at the end of the period, allowing this country to surpass Congo as the largest oil producer.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41511,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3116,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"ARiedqFV5oHk7YxkWGWlaiiSgSh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Izy4d1fdMoRlMuxgmOjlU54cgBe\">Turning to the two smaller producers, which both saw dramatic growth, Somalia produced only an average of 5,000 barrels a day in the first year, while Chad recorded no production for the first three years. After that, Chad started to produce 8,000 barrels per day in 2003<em>,</em> before <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>dramatically increasing its production</strong></span> to 50,000 barrels daily in 2004, which represented the highest <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\"><strong>annual growth</strong></span>. Somalia, meanwhile, <strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">experienced drastic</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">increases in its oil production</span></strong>, reaching the same figure as Chad in the final year.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 41511,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
